FileBrowser Quantum TOS packaging
=================================

This repository packages the official FileBrowser Quantum binary for
TerraMaster TOS 7 as an iframe Deb application. It is a packaging wrapper,
not the upstream FileBrowser Quantum project itself, and it does not claim
copyright in FileBrowser Quantum.

Upstream project
----------------
- Name: FileBrowser Quantum
- Repository: https://github.com/gtsteffaniak/filebrowser
- Version packaged: v2.0.2-stable (TOS wrapper package version 2.0.4)
- Official Linux binaries used unchanged:
  - https://github.com/gtsteffaniak/filebrowser/releases/download/v2.0.2-stable/linux-amd64-filebrowser
  - https://github.com/gtsteffaniak/filebrowser/releases/download/v2.0.2-stable/linux-arm64-filebrowser
- Corresponding source: https://github.com/gtsteffaniak/filebrowser/archive/refs/tags/v2.0.2-stable.tar.gz
  and https://github.com/gtsteffaniak/filebrowser/tree/v2.0.2-stable
- License: Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE)

